# Single source of truth for pinned tool versions LOCAL to this package.
# Sourced by the scripts that need them (tool/platforms_gate.sh,
# tool/ci/upgrade.sh) — bump in ONE place, never inline. Plain KEY="value"
# so it's both shell-sourceable and greppable.
#
#   source "$(dirname "$0")/versions.env"
#
# PANA_VERSION tracks pub.dev's LATEST so the platform gate runs the same
# pana pub.dev runs — or it drifts from the verdict it exists to predict.
# tool/ci/upgrade.sh (the daily upgrade-check.yml pins job) bumps it
# automatically in its own reviewed PR — the same radar as the sibling
# packages.
#
# Deliberately NOT here:
#   wasm-opt (binaryen)   resolved from the Flutter SDK or PATH at build
#                         time (tool/build_wasm.dart) — no download, no sha.
#   Rust nightly pin      a fact about the vendored subject; lives in
#                         build.json (nightlyToolchain).
#   fvm / Chrome / bore   shared pins carried by whuppi/ci's own
#                         versions.env via its capabilities + workflows.
PANA_VERSION="0.23.14"
